    },
    {
      "tr": "`k = round(m / n * math.log(2))`; `return m, k`.",
      "en": "`k = round(m / n * math.log(2))`; `return m, k`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport math\n\n\ndef bloom_size(n, p):\n    m = math.ceil(-n * math.log(p) / math.log(2) ** 2)\n    k = round(m / n * math.log(2))\n    return m, k\n\nprint(bloom_size(1_000_000, 0.01))\nprint(bloom_size(10_000, 0.001))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport math\n\n\ndef bloom_size(n, p):\n    m = math.ceil(-n * math.log(p) / math.log(2) ** 2)\n    k = round(m / n * math.log(2))\n    return m, k\n\nprint(bloom_size(1_000_000, 0.01))\nprint(bloom_size(10_000, 0.001))\n```"
    }
  ],
